# Server image inputs only. Revisit this list when adding Dockerfile COPY inputs.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!crates/**
!config/
config/**
!config/*.example.toml
!packaging/
packaging/**
!packaging/server/
packaging/server/**
!packaging/server/Dockerfile

# Cargo resolves every workspace member, including desktop crates. Keep their
# manifests, source, build scripts, and protobuf inputs, but exclude local state.
**/target
**/.local
**/.git
**/.idea
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.cer
**/*.der
**/*.csr
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/*.log
**/*.log.*
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
**/Thumbs.db
**/Desktop.ini
